<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> a djr:Document ;
    skos:prefLabel "implementation-django-ninja-final"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "# Django Ninja API 구현 종합 가이드"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0649, djr:R-0650, djr:R-0651 ;
    djr:text "\n\n> 이 문서는 Django Ninja로 REST API adapter를 구현할 때의 기준을 정리한다.\n> REST 계약 자체는 `architecture-api` 스킬,\n> Django ORM, service, transaction, migration은\n> `implementation-django` 스킬,\n> pytest fixture와 test-double 세부 구현은\n> `implementation-test` 스킬을 기준으로 한다.\n>\n> Django Ninja는 greenfield API 구현의 기본 목표다. DRF 자료는 legacy review,\n> compatibility 비교, DRF-to-Ninja migration 때만 보조 근거로 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s004-1.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.1 Django Ninja skill의 역할"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0652 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja skill은 HTTP 요청과 응답을 Django application/service/usecase로\n연결하는 adapter 구현을 다룬다. 핵심 책임은 다음이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- Router 등록과 operation 선언\n- path/query/header/body 파라미터를 명시적 schema로 받기\n- authentication/authorization 연결\n- service/usecase 호출\n- domain/application error를 API error contract로 변환\n- response schema와 status code mapping\n- OpenAPI에 드러나는 계약 변화의 candidate·승인 뒤 검증 기준 제시\n- 실제 mount를 통과하는 Django client 기반 HTTP contract 검증 기준 제시\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.2 다른 source reference로 위임할 책임"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0653 ;
    djr:text "\n- REST resource, URL, HTTP method, status code, header, content negotiation,\n  pagination strategy, versioning, rate limit, idempotency contract는\n  `architecture-api`가 결정한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0654 ;
    djr:text "- aggregate, state transition, invariant, policy, usecase boundary, 구조 패턴\n  (repository/UoW/핵사고날/CQRS/outbox/ACL) 선택은 `architecture-ddd`가 결정한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0655 ;
    djr:text "- ORM query, selector, service, transaction, migration, cache, security\n  implementation은 `implementation-django`가 담당한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0656 ;
    djr:text "- pytest fixture, factory, mock/test-double, concurrency test mechanics는\n  `implementation-test`가 담당한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.3 Router thinness 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0657, djr:R-0658 ;
    djr:text "\nRouter operation은 HTTP adapter다. 다음은 Router 안에 둘 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- request schema validation과 parameter binding\n- auth/permission hook 연결\n- service/usecase 호출\n- API-facing DTO 또는 schema로 response mapping\n- known application/domain exception을 BC `ErrorSchema`로 변환\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0659 ;
    djr:text "다음은 Router, Schema, FilterSchema에 두지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- 핵심 business rule과 state transition\n- transaction ownership\n- 복잡한 ORM query construction과 N+1 최적화\n- 외부 SDK 호출 orchestration\n- 여러 entry point에서 재사용해야 하는 object/action authorization policy\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.1 Router 등록"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0660, djr:R-0661 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja는 `NinjaAPI`와 `Router`를 통해 path operation을 등록한다.\n프로젝트의 API namespace와 versioning 방식이 이미 있으면 그 방식을 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0662, djr:R-0663, djr:R-0664, djr:R-0665, djr:R-0666, djr:R-0667 ;
    djr:text "프로젝트에 Django Ninja가 아직 의존성으로 없는 신규 도입이면, 글로벌로 임의 설치하지 말고 의존성 매니페스트(`requirements/*.txt` 등, `implementation-django` §3.1)에 **버전을 핀해 추가**한다 — 핀 표기는 프로젝트의 기존 관례를 따른다(기존 항목이 `Django==4.2.30`처럼 정확 핀이면 `django-ninja==<버전>`으로 맞춘다). 버전 *값*(`<버전>`에 무엇을 핀할지)은 다음 버전-핀 규율을 따른다 — 기억 속/추정 버전을 쓰지 않는다. 설치 시점에 resolve한 실제 버전을 매니페스트(`requirements`/`pyproject`)에 핀으로 기록하되 기존 프레임워크 핀과 호환되는 최신으로 한다. `django-ninja`·`django-ninja-extra` 모두 동일하다. `INSTALLED_APPS`·`NinjaAPI` 인스턴스·URL 등록 같은 런타임 배선도 함께 둔다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0668, djr:R-0669 ;
    djr:text "신규 표준 presentation 표면은 클래스 컨트롤러(§2.3)이므로 **`django-ninja-extra`를 설치하고 `INSTALLED_APPS`에 `'ninja_extra'`를 등록한다**(`NinjaExtraAPI`·`register_controllers` 동작에 필요). 핀 표기·버전 값 규율은 위 `django-ninja`와 동일하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0670 ;
    djr:text "새로운 Router를 추가할 때는 다음을 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- API root와 version prefix가 기존 convention과 일치하는가\n- operation path가 REST resource 계약과 일치하는가\n- operation method가 resource action의 safe/idempotent 의미와 맞는가\n- router-level auth와 operation-level auth override가 의도대로 적용되는가\n- tag, summary, response schema가 OpenAPI에 필요한 만큼 드러나는가\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.2 Operation 선언"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0671, djr:R-0672 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja operation은 decorator의 HTTP method, path, response 선언,\noperation 함수의 typed parameters로 API contract를 만든다. 여러 status code가\n가능한 경우 `response={status: Schema}` 형태로 성공/오류 schema를 분리한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b34> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0683 ;
    djr:text "- `openapi_extra`나 `get_openapi_schema` override·monkeypatch·postprocessor로 오류\n  응답을 수동 선언하거나 사후 변형하지 않는다. operation의 `response=`가 runtime과\n  OpenAPI가 함께 아는 계약이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b29> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0684, djr:R-0685 ;
    djr:text "- known domain/application exception은 컨트롤러가 구체적으로 catch하고, 준비된\n  no-arg concrete `ErrorSchema`를 `Status(<승인된 HTTP status 표현>, error)`로 직접 반환한다. 오류\n  `(status, schema)` tuple, raw `Response`/dict, 오류 helper/factory/serializer/mapper,\n  등록 handler/decorator로 우회하지 않는다(§6.2).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0686 ;
    djr:text "- **operation을 문서화한다** — `summary`·`description`·`tags`를 decorator 인자로 주어 Swagger UI의 그룹과 설명을 채운다. 외부 client가 읽는 계약 문서다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0687 ;
    djr:text "- **반환 타입을 명시한다** — `-> object`처럼 정보 없는 타입을 쓰지 않는다. 직렬화 자체는 `response=`가 결정하지만, 반환 타입 annotation은 사람·mypy를 위한 계약 표현이다. 직접 반환하는 성공 Schema와 BC `ErrorSchema`/`Status`를 실제 흐름에 맞게 표현한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b35> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0688, djr:R-0689 ;
    djr:text "- 선언된 JSON 성공은 Schema 또는 `Status`로 반환한다. `FileResponse`,\n  `StreamingHttpResponse`, redirect, schema-less 204는 framework-native 성공\n  carveout이며 오류 응답 우회를 허용하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0690 ;
    djr:text "Operation은 10번 slot이 승인한 **한 경로**를 선택한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b17> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0691, djr:R-0692, djr:R-0693 ;
    djr:text "- **exception path:** request를 준비한 뒤 `try`에는 최외곽 application call 한 문장만 둔다.\n  구체 exception 또는 구체 exception tuple만 catch하고, catch 안에서 no-arg concrete 또는\n  populated BC-base `ErrorSchema`, 필요하면 주입된 응답용 header를 만든 뒤 두 인자\n  `Status(<승인된 HTTP status 표현>, error)`로 직접 반환한다. 성공 변환은 `try` 뒤에 둔다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b18> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0694, djr:R-0695 ;
    djr:text "- **failed Result/`None`/outcome path:** application call을 정확히 한 번 한 뒤, `try` 없이\n  slot이 승인한 failed branch를 call 바로 다음에 둔다. 같은 ErrorSchema/header/두 인자 `Status`\n  구성을 직접 수행하며, 예외·catch·helper·mapping table을 꾸며내지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom ninja import Status\nfrom ninja_extra import api_controller, route, status\n\nfrom application.order.application_layer.order.place_order.place_order_command import PlaceOrderCommand\nfrom application.order.composition_root.dependency_wiring import build_place_order\nfrom application.order.domain_layer.order.exception.insufficient_stock import InsufficientStock\nfrom application.order.domain_layer.order.exception.product_not_found import ProductNotFound\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.bc_error_schema import (\n    OrderErrorSchema,\n    OrderInsufficientStockError,\n    OrderProductNotFoundError,\n)\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.order.schema.schema_in import OrderIn\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.order.schema.schema_out import OrderOut\n\n\n@api_controller(\"/orders\", tags=[\"orders\"], auto_import=False)\nclass OrderController:\n    @route.post(\n        \"\",\n        response={201: OrderOut, 404: OrderErrorSchema, 409: OrderErrorSchema},\n        summary=\"주문 생성\",\n        description=\"재고가 충분하면 주문을 만들고 201, 부족하면 409로 거절한다.\",\n    )\n    def create_order(\n        self,\n        request,\n        payload: OrderIn,\n    ) -> Status[OrderOut | OrderErrorSchema]:\n        command = PlaceOrderCommand(\n            product_id=payload.product_id,\n            quantity=payload.quantity,\n        )\n        use_case = build_place_order()\n\n        try:\n            order = use_case.execute(command)\n        except ProductNotFound:\n            error = OrderProductNotFoundError()\n            return Status(status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND, error)\n        except InsufficientStock:\n            error = OrderInsufficientStockError()\n            return Status(status.HTTP_409_CONFLICT, error)\n\n        response = OrderOut(id=order.id, status=order.status)\n        return Status(status.HTTP_201_CREATED, response)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0673, djr:R-0674, djr:R-0675 ;
    djr:text "> **형태 선택.** 신규 표준 presentation 표면은 §2.3의 ninja-extra 클래스 컨트롤러다.\n> 기존 함수형 Router는 확립된 표면을 유지할 때 보존한다. 오류 응답 때문에 클래스\n> 컨트롤러를 함수형 Router로 바꾸지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "Operation 구현 기준:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0676 ;
    djr:text "- path parameter, query parameter, request body를 명확히 구분한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0677 ;
    djr:text "- request body와 response body는 별도 schema를 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0678 ;
    djr:text "- create operation은 성공 시 `201`과 필요하면 `Location` header 계약을 맞춘다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0679 ;
    djr:text "- delete 또는 no-body update는 `204`를 사용하고 body를 반환하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0680 ;
    djr:text "- async operation에서 ORM을 직접 호출하지 않도록 Django async ORM 제약을 확인한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b30>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b34> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0681, djr:R-0682 ;
    djr:text "- 직접 반환하는 BC 오류 status는 모두 `response={...}`에 그 BC의 base `ErrorSchema`로\n  선언한다. framework가 소유하는 401/403/route 404/422/429/일반 `HttpError`/미식별\n  500은 BC 오류로 직접 반환하지도, BC `ErrorSchema`로 광고하지도 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.3 클래스 컨트롤러 (ninja-extra) — 신규 표준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0696, djr:R-0697, djr:R-0698, djr:R-0699 ;
    djr:text "\n신규 표준 presentation 표면은 함수형 `@router.post` operation이 아니라 **ninja-extra\n`@api_controller` 클래스 컨트롤러**로 만든다. 함수형 Router operation(§2.2)은 레거시\n경로로 읽고 기존 형태를 보존한다. **touched(신규·수정) presentation 표면은 클래스\n컨트롤러로 만든다.** 406/415나 오류 응답을 이유로 클래스 컨트롤러를 함수형 Router로\n강등하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# config/api.py — 프로젝트가 contract scope의 API 인스턴스 하나를 소유한다.\nfrom ninja_extra import NinjaExtraAPI\n\napi = NinjaExtraAPI()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# application/order/driving_layer/api/api_router.py\nfrom ninja_extra import NinjaExtraAPI\n\nfrom .order.order_controller import OrderController\n\n\ndef register_order_api(api: NinjaExtraAPI) -> None:\n    api.register_controllers(OrderController)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# config/urls.py — explicit composition과 mount를 함께 소유한다.\nfrom django.urls import path\n\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.api_router import register_order_api\nfrom config.api import api\n\nregister_order_api(api)\n\nurlpatterns = [\n    path(\"api/\", api.urls),\n]\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:text "요점:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0712 ;
    djr:text "- registrar는 자기 BC controller만 import하며, 전달받은 `api`에 등록하는 함수 밖에서는\n  아무 등록도 하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0713 ;
    djr:text "- registrar가 `config.api`를 import하거나 모듈 top-level에서 `register_controllers`를\n  호출하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0714 ;
    djr:text "- 프로젝트 `urls.py` 밖에서 registrar를 몰래 호출하거나 직접 controller를 등록하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0715, djr:R-0716, djr:R-0717 ;
    djr:text "- public/internal 또는 version별 API 인스턴스가 이미 독립 계약 surface로 확립돼 **소비자가\n  의존하는** 경우는 승인된 별도 scope로 보존할 수 있다 — 보존의 근거는 «소비자 의존»이지\n  «먼저 작성돼 있음»이 아니다. 신규 BC마다 API 인스턴스를 만드는 것은 scope 분리가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0718, djr:R-0719, djr:R-0720, djr:R-0721 ;
    djr:text "**컴포지션 루트(배선) — `composition_root/`.** operation/메서드 본문에서 `Django…Repository()`·`…Adapter()`를 직접 생성하면 presentation→infra 직접 결합(Q-7)이다. DI 조립은 BC 루트 `application/<bounded_context>/composition_root/`에 모은다 — 결선은 `dependency_wiring.py`가 소유하고 use-case마다 `build_<use_case>()` 팩토리를 두며, presentation은 컨트롤러 메서드에서 그 팩토리를 **호출만** 한다(매요청 조립). 이벤트 구독 결선은 `event_wiring.py`가 따로 진다. use-case 없는 순수 데이터소스 BC는 둘 게 없으니 생략한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b19> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 19 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# application/order/composition_root/dependency_wiring.py — BC 루트의 DI 결선. 구체 infra를 use-case에 주입.\nfrom application.order.application_layer.order.place_order.place_order_use_case import PlaceOrderUseCase\nfrom application.order.driven_layer.adapter.anticorruption_layer.catalog.product_stock_adapter import DjangoProductStockAdapter\nfrom application.order.driven_layer.adapter.persistence.repository.order_repository import DjangoOrderRepository\n\n\ndef build_place_order() -> PlaceOrderUseCase:\n    # 구체 infra를 고르는 유일한 곳 — 안쪽 계층은 domain repository/port 추상에만 의존(DIP).\n    return PlaceOrderUseCase(\n        order_repository=DjangoOrderRepository(),\n        product_stock_port=DjangoProductStockAdapter(),\n    )\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0700, djr:R-0701 ;
    djr:text "클래스 컨트롤러는 함수형 operation의 계약을 그대로 보존한다 — `response={status: Schema}`\n선언과 Schema/`Status` 반환을 유지하며, known exception의 직접 `ErrorSchema` 변환 순서도\n§2.2와 같다. 바뀌는 것은 *형태*뿐이다: Router prefix가 클래스 데코레이터로,\noperation 함수가 `self` 첫 인자를 받는 메서드로 올라간다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b20> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 20 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0722, djr:R-0723 ;
    djr:text "- **단일 파일·BC당 1개**: 컴포지션 루트는 \"구체를 아는 유일한 곳\"이라 한 파일에 모은다 — feature별 `composition/` 폴더로 쪼개면 루트가 분열돼 패턴 위반이다. `config/api.py`나 `api_router.py`(HTTP 등록)에 섞지도 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b21> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 21 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0724, djr:R-0725 ;
    djr:text "- **매요청 호출**: 컨트롤러 메서드에서 `use_case = build_place_order()` 후 `use_case.execute(command)`. 모듈 레벨 전역 인스턴스로 import 시점에 만들지 않는다(import 부작용·테스트 오버라이드 회피).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b22> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 22 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0726, djr:R-0727 ;
    djr:text "- **BC 격리**: order의 루트는 *자기 BC*의 infra/ACL만 import한다(`DjangoProductStockAdapter`는 order `driven_layer/adapter/anticorruption_layer/`; catalog는 직접 import 안 하고 OHS/ACL 경유). `composition_root/`(`dependency_wiring.py`)는 use-case DI만 소유하며 API instance·controller registration을 소유하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b23> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 23 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0728 ;
    djr:text "**설치.** ninja-extra는 별도 앱이다 — `INSTALLED_APPS += ['ninja_extra']`가 필요하다(의존성\n매니페스트 핀은 §2.1과 동일하다).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b24> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 24 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0729 ;
    djr:text "**탐색 → 포함/생성 규칙 (새 operation 추가 시).** 새 operation을 둘 곳은 다음 순서로 정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b25> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 25 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0730 ;
    djr:text "1. 해당 앱 `driving_layer/api/`에서 `@api_controller` 데코 클래스를 grep한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b26> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 26 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0731 ;
    djr:text "2. 단일 컨트롤러가 있으면 → 그 컨트롤러의 메서드로 포함한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b27> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 27 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0732 ;
    djr:text "3. 분할되어 여럿이면 → 리소스(URL prefix)가 일치하는 컨트롤러에 포함하고, 없으면 새 리소스\n   컨트롤러를 만든다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b28> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 28 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0733 ;
    djr:text "4. 컨트롤러가 없으면 → 새 `<Aggregate>Controller`를 생성한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b29> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 29 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "요점:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0702 ;
    djr:text "- 클래스 데코레이터 `@api_controller(\"/orders\", tags=[...], auto_import=False)`가 resource\n  prefix·tag를 소유하고,\n  메서드 데코레이터 `@route.post(\"\")`가 그 prefix 기준 *상대* 경로를 잡는다(함수형의\n  `@router.post(\"/orders\")` 한 줄이 둘로 나뉜 것).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0703, djr:R-0704 ;
    djr:text "- operation 함수가 `self`를 첫 인자로 받는 메서드가 된다. 메서드명은 함수형과 같이 동사구를\n  유지한다(`create_order`).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0705 ;
    djr:text "- `response=`/`Status` 반환, controller-owned 오류 처리, 반환 타입 명시는 §2.2와\n  **동일하게 보존**한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0706 ;
    djr:text "- **`ControllerBase`를 직접 상속하지 않는다** — `@api_controller` 데코레이터가 컨트롤러 기반을\n  자동 주입한다(명시 상속은 중복이다).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0707, djr:R-0708, djr:R-0709, djr:R-0710 ;
    djr:text "**등록 — 프로젝트 소유 API, BC 소유 registrar, URLconf 소유 합성.** contract scope 안에서\n프로젝트 `api.py`가 `NinjaExtraAPI` 인스턴스 하나를 소유한다. 각 BC는 project API를 import하지\n않는 side-effect-free `register_<bc>_api(api)`만 노출한다. 프로젝트 `urls.py`가 API와 registrar를\nimport하고, 각 registrar를 명시적으로 한 번 호출한 뒤 API를 mount한다. BC 모듈 import만으로\nregistration이 일어나면 안 된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0711 ;
    djr:text "명시 registrar 합성을 선택한 controller는 `@api_controller(..., auto_import=False)`로\nNinja Extra auto-import를 끈다. 그래야 controller import가 global registry를 채우는\nside effect를 만들지 않고, 등록 집합과 시점은 `register_<bc>_api(api)`와 프로젝트\n`urls.py` 호출만으로 결정된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.1 Request/response schema 분리"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0734 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja `Schema`는 Pydantic 기반 request/response contract다. 하나의\nmodel을 그대로 노출하는 방식보다, API contract에 맞는 create/update/list/detail\nschema를 분리한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0735 ;
    djr:text "- request schema는 입력 형식과 transport-level validation에 집중한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0736 ;
    djr:text "- response schema는 public field, type, nullable 여부, enum 값을 명시한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0737 ;
    djr:text "- domain invariant는 service/model/DB boundary에서 보장한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0738 ;
    djr:text "- field 제거, rename, type change, 새 required field, status-code/error-shape\n  change는 breaking change로 보고 version/deprecation을 검토한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0739, djr:R-0740, djr:R-0741 ;
    djr:text "- enum성 필드(상태·종류)는 `Literal[...]` 또는 `StrEnum`으로 선언해 OpenAPI 계약에\n  enum으로 노출한다. 도메인 enum에서 파생하되, 계약 안정성을 도메인 리팩터링과 분리해야\n  하면 경계-로컬 `Literal`로 고정한다(published language — `architecture-ddd` §2.5).\n  응답 조립·비교에 원시 리터럴을 흩지 않는다(`discipline-cleancode` §2.14 소비 규율).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0742, djr:R-0743, djr:R-0744, djr:R-0745, djr:R-0746, djr:R-0747, djr:R-0748 ;
    djr:text "- **발행 이벤트 봉투(태그드 유니온)의 discriminator는 1종째부터 domain `StrEnum` 파생으로\n  선언한다**(birth-enum — `architecture-ddd` §3.7). 각 이벤트 Schema의 태그는\n  `event_type: Literal[EventType.PARENT_SAFE_ALERT] = EventType.PARENT_SAFE_ALERT`,\n  봉투는 `Event = Annotated[Union[...], Field(discriminator=\"event_type\")]` — 평\n  (non-Literal) Enum 필드는 discriminator로 쓸 수 없으므로(Pydantic) Literal 파생이\n  유일 경로다. enum 파생과 문자열 Literal은 JSON schema가 동일하게 `const`로 렌더되므로\n  OpenAPI 계약은 불변 — \"계약 안정성 때문에 맨 Literal\"은 이 위치에서 성립하지 않는다.\n  `payload_schema_version` 등 버전 태그는 형태가 같아도 리터럴 동결 유지(발행 순간\n  동결되는 계약 표식 — §3.7 짝 조항). union-enum 동기는 중앙 영구 테스트 입장 심사의\n  candidate다. 승인된 공개 event wire literal과 독자 failure를 보호해 `add/update`인 경우에만\n  직렬화 경계에서 검증한다(`discipline-tdd`; mechanics는 `implementation-test` §15.5).\n  봉투 union을 페이지네이션 응답에 직접 조합하지 않는다\n  (ninja discriminated union+pagination의 OpenAPI 렌더 미해결 버그 — vitalik/django-ninja#1308).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0749, djr:R-0750 ;
    djr:text "Schema의 validator 위치, `ValidationError.loc`, Pydantic/Ninja 기본 validation·직렬화는 그 자체로\n영구 테스트 자격이 아니다. 별도 사용자 승인 또는 실제 deployed consumer evidence가 있는 공개\nPython 계약이면 중앙 입장 심사로 판정할 수 있고, 공개 HTTP·wire 계약이면 isolated Schema 직접 호출이\n아니라 실제 mount 경계에서 검증한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.2 ModelSchema 사용 기준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0751 ;
    djr:text "\n`ModelSchema`는 모델 필드를 API schema로 빠르게 매핑할 때 유용하지만, 다음을\n확인한 뒤 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 내부 필드, 관리 필드, 보안 민감 필드가 노출되지 않는가\n- public API 용어와 DB/model 용어가 다를 때 무리하게 모델명을 노출하지 않는가\n- list/detail/create/update의 field set이 실제로 같은가\n- permission에 따라 field visibility가 달라지는 경우 별도 response mapping이\n  필요한가\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom ninja import ModelSchema\nfrom myapp.models import Article\n\n\n# 노출할 필드를 명시한다 -- 내부/관리/보안 민감 필드는 넣지 않는다\nclass ArticleOut(ModelSchema):\n    class Meta:\n        model = Article\n        fields = [\"id\", \"title\", \"published_at\"]\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s014-3.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.3 Resolver와 computed field"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s014-3.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s014-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0752, djr:R-0753 ;
    djr:text "\nResponse schema의 computed field나 resolver는 표현 mapping에 한정한다. DB 조회,\n권한 판단, domain decision이 필요한 계산은 selector/service에서 끝낸 값을 받아\nmapping한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s014-3.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s014-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.1 Authentication"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0754 ;
    djr:text "\nAuthentication은 caller identity를 판정한다. Django Ninja는 API, Router,\noperation 수준에 auth를 연결할 수 있다. 프로젝트의 기존 auth mechanism이 있으면\n그 adapter를 우선한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "기준:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0755 ;
    djr:text "- API credential은 `Authorization` header 같은 header 기반 전달을 우선한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0756 ;
    djr:text "- secret을 query parameter에 넣지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0757 ;
    djr:text "- 인증 실패 또는 인증 필요는 `401`로 응답한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b31> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0758, djr:R-0759 ;
    djr:text "- auth adapter는 성공 시 identity/principal을 반환한다. 실패는 `None`을 반환하거나\n  framework `AuthenticationError`를 raise한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b30>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b31> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0760, djr:R-0761 ;
    djr:text "- `ErrorSchema`를 auth 결과로 반환하거나 `request.auth`에 저장하지 않는다. framework 401을\n  BC 식별자 body로 바꾸는 전역 변환도 추가하지 않는다(§6.2).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0762 ;
    djr:text "- local development를 제외한 API traffic은 HTTPS를 전제로 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.2 Authorization"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\nAuthorization은 authenticated caller가 action/object에 접근할 수 있는지\n판정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0763 ;
    djr:text "- 단일 endpoint에만 해당하는 단순 gate는 adapter에서 연결할 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0764 ;
    djr:text "- 여러 entry point에서 재사용되는 object/action rule은 service/domain policy로\n  옮긴다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0765 ;
    djr:text "- authenticated caller가 권한이 없으면 `403`으로 응답한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0766 ;
    djr:text "- 존재를 숨겨야 하는 resource는 API contract에 따라 `404`를 사용할 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0767 ;
    djr:text "- object-level permission은 필요한 query shape, selector, prefetch/select_related\n  기준과 함께 검토한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s017-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.1 Filtering과 sorting"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0768 ;
    djr:text "\nFiltering, sorting, search parameter는 public API contract다. Django Ninja\n`FilterSchema`와 `Query[...]` binding은 query parameter validation과 OpenAPI\n가독성을 높일 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "기준:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0769 ;
    djr:text "- 허용 filter와 sort key를 명시한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0770 ;
    djr:text "- user-controlled ORM field name을 그대로 받지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0771 ;
    djr:text "- DB table/model 내부 구조가 public parameter에 새지 않게 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0772 ;
    djr:text "- reusable read logic, query optimization, N+1 방지는 `implementation-django`의\n  selector/QuerySet method로 위임한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0773 ;
    djr:text "- 검색, sparse fieldset, 복합 filter는 `architecture-api`의 계약이 먼저 있어야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0774 ;
    djr:text "(아래는 Ninja 원생 함수형 예시다 — 이 플러그인의 신규 표면은 §2.3 의 클래스 컨트롤러 형태를 쓴다)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s019-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom typing import Optional\nfrom ninja import FilterSchema, Query\n\n\nclass OrderFilter(FilterSchema):\n    status: Optional[str] = None       # 허용 filter key만 명시한다\n\n\n@router.get(\"/orders\", response=list[OrderOut])\ndef list_orders(request, filters: Query[OrderFilter]):\n    use_case = build_list_orders()   # dependency_wiring.py 팩토리 — 매요청 조립(아래 \"컴포지션 루트\")\n    return use_case.execute(ListOrdersQuery(filters=filters))\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.2 Pagination"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0775 ;
    djr:text "\nPagination strategy는 API contract가 결정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 작은 admin-like collection은 offset pagination이 단순하다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0776 ;
    djr:text "- 큰 collection, 실시간 목록, consistency-sensitive 목록은 cursor/keyset을\n  우선 검토한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0777 ;
    djr:text "- page size 상한을 둔다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0778, djr:R-0779 ;
    djr:text "- cursor/keyset은 stable indexed ordering을 사용한다. 일반적으로 timestamp와 id를\n  함께 쓴다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0780 ;
    djr:text "- response에는 다음 페이지를 요청할 수 있는 metadata를 포함한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0781 ;
    djr:text "Django Ninja의 pagination decorator나 `RouterPaginated` 같은 framework 기능을\n사용할 수 있지만, strategy와 response shape는 프로젝트 계약과 맞아야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom ninja.pagination import paginate, PageNumberPagination\n\n\n@router.get(\"/orders\", response=list[OrderOut])\n@paginate(PageNumberPagination)        # page size 상한 등은 NINJA_PAGINATION_* 설정으로\ndef list_orders(request):\n    use_case = build_list_orders()   # dependency_wiring.py 팩토리 — 매요청 조립\n    return use_case.execute(ListOrdersQuery())   # use case가 QuerySet 반환 → paginate가 페이지로 자른다\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s020-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.1 Status code mapping"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0001 ;
    djr:text "\n상태 코드의 의미는 `architecture-api` 기준을 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "- `406`: 응답 표현 협상 실패 — `Accept`를 만족하는 표현 없음 (`architecture-api` §7.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "- `409`: conflict\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:text "- `415`: 요청 페이로드 형식 미지원 — `Content-Type`을 이 리소스가 처리 못 함 (`architecture-api` §7.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:text "- `422`: semantically invalid input 또는 framework validation error 계약\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:text "- `429`: rate limit\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0002, djr:R-0003, djr:R-0004 ;
    djr:text "- `503`: 일시적 서비스 불가(과부하·정비·승인된 일시 경합). 직접 공개하는 retryable BC\n  오류라면 controller가 주입받은 응답용(temporal) Django `HttpResponse`에 승인된 `Retry-After`를\n  설정한 뒤 두 인자 `Status`를 반환한다. 503/409 선택은 명세 §5/G1이 정하고 raw 인프라\n  예외를 controller가 임의 분류하지 않는다(§6.2,\n  `architecture-api` §13.4).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0005 ;
    djr:text "> `406`/`415`의 *처리 메커니즘*은 §6.3(콘텐츠 협상 실패) 참조 — ninja 경계 안에서 내고 전역 미들웨어로 가로채지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0006, djr:R-0007, djr:R-0008, djr:R-0009 ;
    djr:text "Django Ninja validation error의 default status·body는 framework-owned 응답이다. 새\ncode-profile에서는 이를 BC 식별자 body로 맞추기 위한 전역 변환을 추가하지 않으며, 그 body를\n정확하고 안정적인 공개 식별자 계약이라고 주장하지 않는다. 별도 공개 계약이 필요하면 G1로\n돌아가 profile과 호환성 범위를 먼저 승인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- `200`: body를 반환하는 read/update 성공\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- `201`: resource 생성\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `202`: 비동기 작업 접수\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- `204`: body 없는 delete/update 성공\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "- `400`: malformed request\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "- `401`: authentication 실패 또는 필요\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "- `403`: authorization 부족\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s022-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "- `404`: resource 없음 또는 존재 숨김\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.2 `dddjango-code-json` 오류 프로필"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0010, djr:R-0011 ;
    djr:text "\n오류 프로필 선택은 `architecture-api` §5.4를 따른다. 이미 배포된 범위는 관찰한 계약을\n보존하고, 새 dddjango Django Ninja 범위의 기본은 `dddjango-code-json`이다. 이 절은 그\n기본 프로필의 copy-safe 구현 기준이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0037 ;
    djr:text "- 공통 `FrameworkErrorSchema`를 상속하고 slot 6의 식별자 필드 하나만 `<Bc>ErrorCode`로 좁히는 `<Bc>ErrorSchema` 하나\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0038 ;
    djr:text "- 반복해서 반환할 사건별 concrete `ErrorSchema` subclass\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0039 ;
    djr:text "- BC가 공개하는 모든 식별자 문자열 값은 프로젝트 전체 code-profile inventory에서 중복되지 않는 값\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# application/order/driving_layer/api/bc_error_schema.py\nfrom enum import StrEnum\n\nfrom framework.ninja.framework_error_schema import FrameworkErrorSchema\n\n\nclass OrderErrorCode(StrEnum):\n    PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND = \"order_product_not_found\"\n    INSUFFICIENT_STOCK = \"order_insufficient_stock\"\n    TEMPORARILY_UNAVAILABLE = \"order_temporarily_unavailable\"\n    VERSION_MISMATCH = \"order_version_mismatch\"\n\n\nclass OrderErrorSchema(FrameworkErrorSchema):\n    # slot 6에서 지정한 공통 식별자 필드를 OrderErrorCode로 좁힌다.\n    ...\n\n\nclass OrderProductNotFoundError(OrderErrorSchema):\n    # slot 6의 모든 required field에 승인된 default를 제공한다.\n    # 식별자 default는 OrderErrorCode.PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND다.\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0040, djr:R-0041, djr:R-0042, djr:R-0043, djr:R-0044, djr:R-0045, djr:R-0046, djr:R-3401 ;
    djr:text "BC base의 식별자 field는 공통 annotation의 wrapper/nullability·required/default와 default를\n제외한 `Field(...)` metadata를 보존하고 `str` 자리만 자기 Enum으로 좁힌다. 단 좁힌 식별자\nfield는 공통의 default를 잃어 required여도 canon이다(식별자 field 한정·ErrorCode 좁힘 동반일\n때만 — 2026-08-15). 공통 default가\n문자열이면 같은 wire value의 Enum member로 표현한다. concrete 오류는 slot 6에서 해당\nconcrete의 고정값으로 승인된 모든 required field에 default가 있어 인자 없이 생성한다.\n새 필드·validator·child `model_config`나 annotation/Field metadata drift를 concrete subclass에\n추가하지 않고, 승인 alias 등이 있는 field를 재선언하면 같은 metadata를 반복한다. 단 공통\nannotation이 Field metadata 없는 벗겨진 스칼라 자리(식별자 field는 base가 좁힌 Enum 자리)인\nconcrete field는 slot 6에서 승인된 그 concrete의 고정값 하나의 `Literal`로 자리를 더 좁히고\n같은 값을 default로 병기해도 canon이다(plain `=` 표기 한정·좁힘값=default 동일·\nwrapper/nullability 좁힘 불포함·무인자 생성 계약은 그대로 만족 — 식별자형은 §3.1 이벤트\ndiscriminator와 같은 표기·비식별자는 스칼라 상수로 확장 · 2026-08-24). URI·instance\n같은 다른 profile 필드도 섞지 않는다. 오류마다 파일을 나누거나 validation 전용 두 번째 오류\nschema 파일을 만들지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0047, djr:R-0048, djr:R-0049, djr:R-0050, djr:R-0051 ;
    djr:text "한 operation에서만 의미가 생기는 사건이고 별도 concrete type이 필요하지 않다고 승인된\n경우에는 BC base를 직접 채울 수 있다. 이것은 concrete를 인자와 함께 생성하는 우회가 아니다.\n실제 controller의 `OrderErrorSchema(...)` 호출에 slot 6의 모든 field keyword와 승인된 값을 그\n자리에서 전부 명시하는 것이 아니라, 모든 required field와 그 사건에서 기본값을 덮어써야 하는\n승인 optional field만 keyword로 명시한다. 다음 문장에서\n`Status(status.HTTP_409_CONFLICT, error)`를 반환한다.\ndictionary unpacking, builder, factory, mapping table로 field 작성을 우회하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0052, djr:R-0053 ;
    djr:text "**컨트롤러가 변환을 소유한다.** known domain/application failure의 공개 식별자·status 선택은\n해당 BC controller가 한다. 짧은 반복 mapping은 의도적인 지역 중복이며, 다음 순서를\n10번 slot이 승인한 한 path로 보인다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0054, djr:R-0055, djr:R-0056, djr:R-0057 ;
    djr:text "1. **exception path:** 입력 Schema를 준비하고 `try`에는 최외곽 application call 한 문장만\n   둔다. 구체 known exception 또는 구체 exception tuple만 catch해 no-arg concrete 또는\n   populated BC-base `ErrorSchema`, 필요하면 주입된 응답용 header를 만든 뒤 두 인자\n   `Status(<승인된 HTTP status 표현>, error)`를 직접 반환한다. status 표현은 literal/Ninja\n   status 상수 또는 slot 6이 실제로 승인한 body field 접근일 수 있다. 성공 변환은 `try` 뒤에 둔다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0058, djr:R-0059, djr:R-0060 ;
    djr:text "2. **failed Result/`None`/outcome path:** 입력 Schema를 준비한 뒤 application call을 정확히\n   한 번 하고, `try` 없이 승인된 failure branch를 call 바로 다음에 둔다. 같은 ErrorSchema/header/\n   두 인자 Status 구성을 직접 수행하며, 성공 변환은 그 branch 뒤에 둔다. 예외·catch·helper·\n   mapping table을 꾸며내지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b19> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 19 ;
    djr:text "§2.2가 sync concrete-catch 예시다. async와 동일한 contract는 다음과 같다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0012, djr:R-0013, djr:R-0014, djr:R-0015, djr:R-0016, djr:R-0017 ;
    djr:text "**공통 core와 변경 gate.** dddjango는 공통 body property를 정하지 않는다. 기존 프로젝트는\n관찰된 기존 오류 schema exact shape를 기준선으로 보존한다. 신규 scope는 exact field set·각 type·\nrequired/default·nullable·Field metadata·model config/legacy Config·validator/serializer/computed field/Pydantic hook inventory와 effective semantics·wire 직렬화를 G1 slot 6에서 먼저 제안하고 별도로\n명시 승인받는다. 기준선의 property 추가·삭제·이름·타입·존재성·변환 규칙·의미 변경도 일반\n기능 승인에 묻히지 않는 별도 contract 변경이다. 호환성 영향과 server/client/test 전환 범위를\n보여 준 뒤 사용자가 명시 승인하기 전에는 코드부터 바꾸지 않는다. `code/title/status/detail`과\n`error_type/msg/is_show`는 모두 가능한 프로젝트 계약 예일 뿐 plugin 기본값이 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b20> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 20 ;
    djr:text "```python\n@route.get(\n    \"/{order_id}\",\n    response={200: OrderOut, 404: OrderErrorSchema},\n    summary=\"주문 조회\",\n    description=\"주문을 조회한다.\",\n)\nasync def get_order(\n    self,\n    request,\n    order_id: int,\n) -> OrderOut | Status[OrderErrorSchema]:\n    query_value = GetOrderQuery(order_id=order_id)\n    use_case = build_get_order()\n\n    try:\n        order = await use_case.execute(query_value)\n    except (OrderNotFound, ArchivedOrderNotFound):\n        error = OrderProductNotFoundError()\n        return Status(status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND, error)\n\n    return OrderOut.from_result(order)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b21> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 21 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0061, djr:R-0062, djr:R-0063 ;
    djr:text "`try` 안에 준비·분기·로그·성공 변환을 넣지 않는다. `Exception`, framework exception,\nraw DB/SDK exception을 catch하지 않고, 컨트롤러가 방금 raise한 예외를 즉시 catch하지\n않는다. 서로 다른 공개 의미가 필요한 known exception은 별도 catch와 concrete로 나누고,\n같은 공개 의미로 수렴할 때만 tuple catch를 쓴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b22> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 22 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0064, djr:R-0065 ;
    djr:text "다음은 10번 slot이 `ReserveOrderInsufficientStockResult`를 승인된 failed Result로 정한\n경우의 controller-owned 직접 변환이다. application command/Result variant는 application\nlayer DTO에서 import하고 use case는 BC `composition_root`에서 조립한다. call 뒤 branch가 BC\n`ErrorSchema`를 만들며 예외 path나 presentation helper를 흉내 내지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b23> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 23 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom typing import assert_never\n\nfrom ninja import Status\nfrom ninja_extra import api_controller, route, status\n\nfrom application.order.application_layer.order.reserve_order.reserve_order_command import (\n    ReserveOrderCommand,\n)\nfrom application.order.application_layer.order.reserve_order.reserve_order_result import (\n    ReserveOrderInsufficientStockResult,\n    ReserveOrderResult,\n    ReserveOrderSucceededResult,\n)\nfrom application.order.composition_root.dependency_wiring import build_reserve_order\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.bc_error_schema import (\n    OrderErrorSchema,\n    OrderInsufficientStockError,\n)\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.order.schema.schema_in import OrderIn\nfrom application.order.driving_layer.api.order.schema.schema_out import OrderOut\n\n\n@api_controller(\"/orders\", tags=[\"orders\"], auto_import=False)\nclass OrderController:\n    @route.post(\n        \"/reserve\",\n        response={201: OrderOut, 409: OrderErrorSchema},\n        summary=\"주문 예약\",\n        description=\"재고가 부족하면 409, 가능하면 예약 주문을 만든다.\",\n    )\n    def reserve_order(\n        self,\n        request,\n        payload: OrderIn,\n    ) -> Status[OrderOut | OrderErrorSchema]:\n        command = ReserveOrderCommand(\n            order_id=payload.order_id,\n            quantity=payload.quantity,\n        )\n        use_case = build_reserve_order()\n        result: ReserveOrderResult = use_case.execute(command)\n\n        if isinstance(result, ReserveOrderInsufficientStockResult):\n            error = OrderInsufficientStockError()\n            return Status(status.HTTP_409_CONFLICT, error)\n\n        if isinstance(result, ReserveOrderSucceededResult):\n            response = OrderOut.from_result(result.order)\n            return Status(status.HTTP_201_CREATED, response)\n\n        assert_never(result)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b24> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 24 ;
    djr:text "application-owned closed `ReserveOrderResult`와 `assert_never`가 mapping을 exhaustive하게 만든다.\n새 variant나 untyped 값은 `None`으로 조용히 반환되거나 BC 오류로 꾸며지지 않고 framework-owned\n500 계약 위반으로 드러난다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b25> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 25 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0066, djr:R-0067 ;
    djr:text "반대로 use case가 계약상 Result/`None`을 native 성공으로 반환하면 controller가 그 값을 helper\n없이 직접 성공 계약으로 반환할 수 있다. `None`/Result 자체가 언제나 실패라는 뜻은 아니다.\n12-slot이 그 operation의 의미를 결정하며, 실패를 Result의 익명 dict나 `None`으로 숨기는 규칙은\n아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b26> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 26 ;
    djr:text "```python\nresult = query.execute(query_value)\n\nif result is None:\n    return None\nreturn result\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b27> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 27 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0068, djr:R-0069 ;
    djr:text "승인된 BC 오류 헤더도 같은 controller가 소유하되 `Status` 생성자에 header를 넘기지 않는다.\n명세가 retryable BC 503과 `Retry-After`를 승인했다면 controller method가 주입된 응답용(temporal)\nDjango `HttpResponse`를 받아 선택된 mapping branch에서 header를 설정한 뒤 두 인자 `Status`를\n반환한다. exception path의 구체 catch는 그 branch의 한 형태다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b28> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 28 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom django.http import HttpResponse\n\n\n@route.post(\n    \"/retry\",\n    response={200: OrderOut, 503: OrderErrorSchema},\n    summary=\"주문 재시도\",\n    description=\"일시 경합이면 재시도 시점을 안내한다.\",\n)\ndef retry_order(\n    self,\n    request,\n    response: HttpResponse,\n    payload: RetryOrderIn,\n) -> OrderOut | Status[OrderErrorSchema]:\n    command = RetryOrderCommand(order_id=payload.order_id)\n    use_case = build_retry_order()\n\n    try:\n        order = use_case.execute(command)\n    except OrderContention:\n        response[\"Retry-After\"] = \"1\"\n        error = OrderTemporarilyUnavailableError()\n        return Status(status.HTTP_503_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE, error)\n\n    return OrderOut.from_result(order)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b29> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 29 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0070, djr:R-0071, djr:R-0072, djr:R-0073, djr:R-0074 ;
    djr:text "**추출 금지.** 오류 응답 helper/factory/serializer/mapping, exception handler,\nhandler 등록 decorator, generic response builder를 만들거나 호출하지 않는다.\n여기서 serializer와 decorator는 `ErrorSchema`를 HTTP 응답으로 바꾸는 변환기와 예외 handler 등록을 뜻한다.\n승인된 common Schema 자체의 Pydantic validator/serializer/decorator/hook은 exact shape의 일부로 보존한다.\n오류를 raw `Response`/`JsonResponse`/`HttpResponse`, dict, tuple로 만들지 않고\n`model_dump`를 직접 호출하지 않는다. controller가 짧은 exception→concrete mapping과\n`Status` 반환을 직접 소유해야 runtime 직렬화와 `response=` 선언이 한눈에 대응한다.\n여러 controller의 짧은 반복은 이 명시성을 위해 허용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0018, djr:R-0019, djr:R-0020, djr:R-0021, djr:R-0022, djr:R-0023, djr:R-0024, djr:R-0025, djr:R-0026, djr:R-0027, djr:R-0028 ;
    djr:text "기존 승인 shape의 canonical common/BC schema 정의에 있는 dynamic field default·validator/serializer/\nPydantic hook·custom config/decorator 또는 project·relative import/dynamic binding은 코드를 단순화하거나\nexplicit alias를 새로 넣어 우회하지 않는다. class-header `**`·legacy `Config` 상속·non-alias config callable·config mutation을 포함한\n임의 Python의 import-time·호출-time 의미 때문에 schema checker가 항상\n`DYNAMIC_ERROR_SHAPE_PROOF_REQUIRED`를 낸다. canonical module의 직접 import-time mutation/side effect는\nproof 대상이 아니라 구조 위반으로 차단한다. controller/OpenAPI checker가 단순 형태를 정적으로\n계산해 추가 진단을 내더라도 이 marker를 없애지 않는다. target의 실제 dependency pin에서 model\nfield/validation path/serialization alias와 실제 BC-base 생성 key·ErrorCode 멤버·exact dump를\n검토하는 것은 별도 shape 승인 근거를 위한 일회성 분석이며 영구 테스트를 자동 생성하지 않는다.\nmounted status/body와 generated OpenAPI는 각각 중앙 입장 심사의 공개 wire 후보이고,\n`add/update`일 때만 §8–§9의 mount 경계 recipe로 검증한다. API와\ndiscipline reviewer가 기존 shape 무변경을 확인한 경우에만 Coordinator가\n`RESOLVED_DYNAMIC_ERROR_SHAPE_ANALYSIS`로 해소한다. 이는 새 shape나 shape 변경의 별도 사용자 명시\n승인을 대신하지 않고, 다른 analysis/blocker를 면제하지도 않는다. controller 등 schema 소유 경계\n밖의 model config mutation은 기존 shape 보존 경로가 아니다. 선택 module의 직접 mutation과 직접\nimport한 module-level callable 경로는 owning controller checker가 차단한다. imported class method·\n2-hop·dynamic dispatch는 결정적 AST 증명 범위 밖이므로 checker 통과로 면제하지 않고 API/discipline\nreviewer가 직접 읽는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b30> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 30 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0075, djr:R-0076, djr:R-0077, djr:R-0078 ;
    djr:text "**framework 오류 경계.** 인증 401, 인가 403, route 404, request validation 422,\nthrottling 429, 일반 `HttpError`, 미식별 500은 framework가 소유한다. 새 code-profile은\n이를 BC `ErrorSchema`/`<Bc>ErrorCode`로 바꾸지 않으며, 전역 handler나 catch-all mapper로\n가로채지 않는다. 깨진 JSON과 framework validation body도 정확하고 안정적인\n`dddjango-code-json` wire contract라고 주장하지 않는다. framework status를 특정 BC의\n`response={...}`에 광고하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b31> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 31 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0079, djr:R-0080, djr:R-0081 ;
    djr:text "authentication adapter의 성공 반환값은 identity/principal이다. 실패는 `None`을 반환하거나\nframework `AuthenticationError`를 raise한다. `request.auth`에 `ErrorSchema`를 저장하거나\n`ErrorSchema`를 인증 결과로 반환하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b32> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 32 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom ninja.errors import AuthenticationError\nfrom ninja.security import HttpBearer\n\n\nclass BearerAuth(HttpBearer):\n    def authenticate(self, request, token):\n        principal = authenticate_token(token)\n        if principal is None:\n            return None\n        if principal.is_disabled:\n            raise AuthenticationError\n        return principal\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b33> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 33 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0082, djr:R-0083, djr:R-0084, djr:R-0085 ;
    djr:text "**인프라 오류 경계.** raw `OperationalError`, `IntegrityError`, SDK/network 오류를\ncontroller나 전역 recognizer가 문자열·SQLSTATE로 분류하지 않는다. 기본은 framework의\n미식별 500 경로다. 특정 실패가 안정된 공개 의미를 가진다고 G1에서 승인된 경우에만 infra/ACL이\n그 실패를 자기 BC의 구체 domain/application exception으로 정규화하고, controller가 그\n구체 exception을 위의 직접 흐름으로 처리한다. 인프라 예외를 합성하거나 다른 BC exception을\n그대로 통과시키지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b34> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 34 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0086, djr:R-0087, djr:R-0088, djr:R-0089, djr:R-0090 ;
    djr:text "**응답 선언과 OpenAPI.** controller가 직접 반환할 수 있는 각 BC 오류 status는 operation의\n`response={...}`에서 같은 BC base `<Bc>ErrorSchema`에 매핑한다. concrete class는 runtime\ninstance를 고정하지만 OpenAPI status mapping에는 BC base를 쓴다. 직접 반환하지 않는\nframework status는 BC base로 선언하지 않는다. 오류 응답 선언을 `openapi_extra`로 보충하거나\n`get_openapi_schema` override, monkeypatch, postprocessor로 사후 변형하지 않는다. 공개 OpenAPI\n후보가 중앙 입장 심사에서 `add/update`이면 mounted API의 생성 문서에서 status별 BC base schema를 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b35> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 35 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0091, djr:R-0092, djr:R-0093 ;
    djr:text "선언된 JSON 성공은 Schema 또는 `Status`를 통해 Ninja의 validation/serialization을 탄다.\n`FileResponse`, `StreamingHttpResponse`, redirect, schema-less 204는 성공 응답의\nframework-native carveout이다. 어느 carveout도 오류 helper나 raw 오류 응답을 허용하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b36> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 36 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0094, djr:R-0095, djr:R-0096, djr:R-0097 ;
    djr:text "**승인된 wire 보존 — 근거는 소비자 의존.** 기존 범위가 RFC 9457 Problem Details를 이미 공개하고\n소비자·테스트가 승인된 wire contract에 의존한다면 관찰한 status, body, header, media type을\n그대로 보존한다. 보존이 정당한 근거는 둘뿐이다 — ⑴ 밖이 의존한다(wire shape) ⑵ 되돌릴 수 없다.\n«먼저 작성돼 있음»(brownfield)은 근거가 아니며 코드의 «자리»는 둘 어디에도 안 걸린다(자리는\n백스톱 위반 = 리팩터링 대상). 이 짧은 carveout은 wire 계약을 지키기 위한 것이며, 새\nhelper·handler 레시피나 code-profile과의 혼합을 제시하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0029, djr:R-0030 ;
    djr:text "새 단일-scope code-profile의 공통 오류 모듈은 `framework/ninja/framework_error_schema.py`\n하나다(validation 응답 schema가 필요하면 `framework_validation_error_schema.py`).\n`framework/ninja/`는 공유 `<technology>` 폴더라 이 계약 밖의 다른 `<module>.py`와 공존한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "```text\nframework/ninja/\n├── __init__.py\n└── framework_error_schema.py\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# framework/ninja/framework_error_schema.py\nfrom ninja import Schema\n\n\nclass FrameworkErrorSchema(Schema):\n    # slot 6에서 승인된 프로젝트 고유 필드만 그대로 선언한다.\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0031, djr:R-0032, djr:R-0033, djr:R-0034 ;
    djr:text "공통 `FrameworkErrorSchema`는 slot 6에서 승인된 transport core shape만 소유한다. concrete 오류와 BC\nErrorCode catalog를 이 파일에 추가하지 않으며, 승인 shape 밖의 validator·field metadata·임의\nextension bag도 발명하지 않는다. 독립된 public/internal,\nversion, namespace가 실제로 다른 계약 scope라면 G1에서 scope와 공통 경로를 각각 승인한다.\n기존 공용 경로가 있으면 승인된 동등 계약을 우선 재사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0035 ;
    djr:text "**BC 오류 언어.** 오류를 직접 공개하는 각 BC는\n`application/<bc>/driving_layer/api/bc_error_schema.py` 파일 하나에 다음을 함께 둔다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0036 ;
    djr:text "- `<Bc>ErrorCode(StrEnum)` 하나\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.3 콘텐츠 협상 실패 (406/415)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0782, djr:R-0783 ;
    djr:text "\n`406`/`415` 계약은 `architecture-api` §7.2에서 별도 승인한 경우에만 구현한다.\n새 code-profile의 모든 endpoint에 자동으로 강제하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0784, djr:R-0785 ;
    djr:text "- **406**: 실제로 여러 응답 표현을 제공하고 `Accept` 협상이 승인된 operation만 Ninja\n  경계에서 header를 검사한다. 만족하는 표현이 없으면 framework\n  `HttpError(406, \"Not acceptable\")`를 raise한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0786, djr:R-0787, djr:R-0788 ;
    djr:text "- **415**: 지원 media type을 제한하는 계약이 별도 승인된 endpoint만 처리한다.\n  사용 중인 Django Ninja 버전에서 parser 예외가 다른 status로 정규화될 수 있으므로,\n  현재 presentation 스타일과 호환되는 Ninja-owned pre-body 경계를 선택하고\n  공개 415 wire를 중앙 입장 심사의 candidate로 제출한다. `add/update`이면 실제 URLconf에\n  mount된 Django client로 `HttpError(415, \"Unsupported media type\")`가 415로 나가는지 검증한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0789, djr:R-0790 ;
    djr:text "- 406/415는 framework `HttpError` body를 그대로 사용한다. BC `ErrorSchema`, code,\n  오류 helper, custom handler, raw response를 만들지 않고 BC `response={...}`에도\n  광고하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0791, djr:R-0792 ;
    djr:text "- 클래스 컨트롤러를 415 때문에 함수형 Router로 바꾸지 않는다. 기존 함수형 Router도\n  오류 때문에 클래스 컨트롤러로 자동 변환하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0793, djr:R-0794 ;
    djr:text "- 어느 경로에서도 `request.body`/`json.loads`로 본문을 수동 파싱하지 않는다.\n  request body는 선언적 `payload: Schema`가 받는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0795 ;
    djr:text "- Django 전역 middleware, root URL wrapper, 별도 dispatcher처럼 Ninja 라우팅 밖에서\n  status를 합성하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0796 ;
    djr:text "별도 승인이 없으면 framework의 현재 content negotiation/parsing 동작을 보존하고,\n그 body를 정확한 code-profile 공개 계약이라고 주장하지 않는다.\n\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 7. Idempotency-Key"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0797, djr:R-0798 ;
    djr:text "\nDuplicate-prone POST, 특히 order/payment 생성은 `Idempotency-Key` 정책을\nAPI adapter만으로 처리하지 않는다. contract, durable storage, transaction,\nconcurrency behavior가 함께 결정되어야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "기준:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0799 ;
    djr:text "- key 요구 여부, TTL, scope, payload mismatch behavior를 API contract에 둔다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0800 ;
    djr:text "- 첫 요청 결과를 DB 또는 Redis 등 durable storage에 저장한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0801 ;
    djr:text "- 같은 key와 같은 payload의 재시도는 저장된 첫 응답을 반환한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0802 ;
    djr:text "- 생성된 resource가 나중에 변할 수 있으면 현재 resource를 재조회하지 말고 첫 응답\n  snapshot 또는 immutable DTO를 저장한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0803 ;
    djr:text "- 같은 key와 다른 payload는 conflict로 처리한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0804 ;
    djr:text "- DB unique constraint, lock, transaction boundary는 `architecture-db`와\n  `implementation-django`가 소유한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 8. OpenAPI"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja는 typed operation과 schema에서 OpenAPI 문서를 생성한다. 구현 변경은\nruntime behavior뿐 아니라 generated schema의 client-visible contract를 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0805, djr:R-0806, djr:R-0807 ;
    djr:text "아래 항목은 자동 테스트 목록이 아니라 중앙 영구 테스트 입장 심사의 candidate다. 공개 OpenAPI\n계약과 독자 failure를 보호해 `add/update`인 항목만 프로젝트 URLconf에 mount된 API가 생성하는\n문서에서 검증한다. isolated Schema나 미등록 Router/controller가 만든 문서는 공개 OpenAPI 증거가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "입장 심사 후보:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- path, method, tag, operation id, summary\n- request body, query/path/header parameter\n- required/optional/nullable field\n- enum, format, default\n- status별 response schema\n- 직접 반환하는 BC status별 `<Bc>ErrorSchema` schema와 승인 식별자 field의 Enum 값\n- framework-owned status가 BC `ErrorSchema`로 잘못 광고되지 않는지\n- auth/security requirement\n- pagination/filtering parameter와 response metadata\n- deprecation/versioning note\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0808, djr:R-0809 ;
    djr:text "OpenAPI generation 또는 schema diff를 실행하지 않았다면 실행했다고 말하지 않는다.\nDRF-to-Ninja migration에서는 가능한 경우 기존 DRF schema와 Django Ninja schema를\n비교하고 차이를 기록한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.1 공개 HTTP 검증 범위"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0810, djr:R-0811, djr:R-0812 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja HTTP 항목도 먼저 `discipline-tdd`의 중앙 입장 심사를 거친다. 아래는 자동 테스트\n목록이 아니라 candidate이며, 승인된 공개 HTTP 계약과 독자 production failure가 `add/update`인\n경우에만 테스트를 작성한다. Business rule은 승인된 domain/service boundary에서 검증한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- request schema validation\n- status code와 header\n- response schema field/type\n- auth/permission wiring\n- 직접 반환한 BC 오류의 slot-6 exact body shape와 mapping별 HTTP status\n- pagination/filtering/sorting parameter\n- idempotency replay와 conflict\n- DRF-to-Ninja compatibility\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0813, djr:R-0814 ;
    djr:text "공개 HTTP 계약은 `django.test.Client` 또는 프로젝트가 이미 쓰는 동등한 Django client로 실제\nURLconf에 mount된 endpoint를 호출한다. `ninja.testing.TestClient(router)`나\n`ninja_extra.testing.TestClient(Controller)`로 미등록 Router/controller를 직접 감싼 결과는 공개\nmount·registrar·middleware·URL prefix를 통과하지 않으므로 공개 HTTP 계약의 영구 증거가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom django.test import Client\n\n\ndef test_create_order_returns_201():\n    client = Client()\n    res = client.post(\n        \"/api/orders\",  # 프로젝트 URLconf에 실제 mount된 경로\n        {\"product_id\": 7, \"quantity\": 2},\n        content_type=\"application/json\",\n    )\n    assert res.status_code == 201\n    assert res.json()[\"status\"] == \"created\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0815, djr:R-0816, djr:R-0817 ;
    djr:text "Framework 기본 401/403/404/422/429 body, Pydantic/Ninja 기본 직렬화, validator 배치,\n`ValidationError.loc`, private/helper/handler 직접 호출은 그 자체로 test 자격이 아니다. 별도 승인된\n공개 Python consumer 계약은 중앙 입장 심사를 통과하면 그 공개 boundary에서 테스트할 수 있지만,\n그 근거가 없으면 오류 helper/handler 내부 unit test를 만들지 않는다. 승인된 공개 status/body/header,\nwire Enum·security 계약을 실제 mount에서 검증하는 테스트까지 금지하는 규칙은 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.2 검증 보고 기준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0818 ;
    djr:text "\n검증 보고에는 실제 실행한 명령이나 검토한 artifact만 쓴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- focused pytest path\n- mounted Django client test run\n- mounted API의 OpenAPI generation command 또는 generated document\n- schema comparison artifact\n- compatibility checklist\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0819, djr:R-0820 ;
    djr:text "실행하지 않은 mounted client, pytest, OpenAPI, compatibility check는 `Not run`으로\n분명히 표시한다. Skill/reference loading command는 사용자 작업 검증으로 보고하지\n않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s029-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 10. DRF-to-Ninja migration"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0821, djr:R-0822 ;
    djr:text "\nDRF `Serializer`, `ViewSet`, `APIView`, `DefaultRouter`, `rest_framework` 요청이\ngreenfield work라면 Django Ninja 구현으로 전환한다. Legacy code review 또는 migration\n작업이라면 DRF behavior를 source behavior로 읽고 Django Ninja target contract와 비교한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "Migration checklist:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- URL, path parameter, method\n- status code와 response body 존재 여부\n- request/response field 이름, type, nullable, required\n- validation error shape\n- auth/permission behavior\n- pagination, filtering, sorting\n- throttling/rate limiting\n- exception mapping과 선택한 오류 프로필 compatibility\n- OpenAPI schema\n- client deprecation/migration note\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0823, djr:R-0824 ;
    djr:text "DRF-specific abstraction을 새 greenfield 표준으로 유지하지 않는다. 필요한 behavior는\nDjango Ninja Router/Schema, service validation, controller-owned 오류 변환, mounted Django client 검증으로\n옮긴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 11. 라우팅 기준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0825 ;
    djr:text "\n- REST contract가 undecided이면 `architecture-api`를 먼저 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0826 ;
    djr:text "- DB consistency, idempotency storage, lock, transaction이 undecided이면\n  `architecture-db`와 `implementation-django`를 먼저 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0827 ;
    djr:text "- domain invariant/state transition이 undecided이면 `architecture-ddd`를 먼저 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0828 ;
    djr:text "- Router/Schema 구현이 주 작업이고 계약이 충분히 정해졌으면\n  `implementation-django-ninja`를 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0829 ;
    djr:text "- pytest fixture, factory, mock/test-double 세부 구현이 주 작업이면\n  `implementation-test`를 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0830 ;
    djr:text "- risky domain work가 DDD, DB, API, Django, tests를 함께 건드리면 각 영역의\n  owning reference(`architecture-ddd`, `architecture-db`, `architecture-api`,\n  `implementation-django`)를 함께 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .
